  "description": "Variation of condition 1 (Approved Plans) attached to planning permission ref 2026/0746 dated 02/07/2026 for the erection of a two-storey roof extension alongside associated external alterations and partial demolition of the existing building to create a private garden. The variation comprises removal of the setback to the north elevation and reduction of the setback to the west elevation at fourth floor; increase in parapet heights to the third-floor terrace; and alterations to the main roof to increase the height and include a roof-level enclosure.",
  "last_date_consultation_comments": "04/09/2026",
