  "id": "Hackney-2026_1682",
  "cil_liability": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed variation would result in an overbearing form of development that fails to remain subordinate to the host building and wider terrace. The increased scale, bulk, and massing disrupt the townscape hierarchy by failing to step down appropriately from the adjoining Quadra Court toward lower-rise properties to the north, resulting in an overly prominent feature that harms the visual amenities and character of the streetscape. Consequently, the proposal is contrary to policies D1 (London&#x27;s Form, Character and Capacity for Growth), D3 (Optimising Site Capacity Through the Design-Led Approach), and D4 (Delivering Good Design) of the London Plan (2021), policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP17 (Housing Design Standards) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020), and the Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2026).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ]
